@startuml client-journey
skinparam backgroundColor #F8FAFC
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam defaultFontName Arial
skinparam defaultFontColor #172033
skinparam sequenceArrowColor #2563EB
skinparam sequenceLifeLineBorderColor #CBD5E1
skinparam sequenceParticipantBorderColor #2563EB
skinparam sequenceParticipantBackgroundColor #EFF6FF
skinparam sequenceGroupBorderColor #94A3B8
skinparam sequenceGroupBackgroundColor #F1F5F9
title Smart Credit — основной путь до демо-выдачи

actor "Клиент" as User
participant "web / Swagger" as UI
participant "client-service" as Client
queue "Kafka" as Kafka
participant "bank-service" as Bank
participant "bureau-mocks" as Bureau
participant "scoring" as Scoring
database "client_db" as CDB
database "bank_db" as BDB

User -> UI: Профиль, продукт, черновик, документ
UI -> Client: HTTP create / upload / submit
Client -> CDB: Заявка + ApplicationSubmitted в outbox
Client -> Kafka: client.events: ApplicationSubmitted
Kafka -> Bank: Доставка события
Bank -> BDB: Дело: VALIDATION
Bank -> Bureau: gRPC проверка компании и БКИ
Bureau --> Bank: Синтетические ответы
Bank -> Scoring: gRPC Score
Scoring --> Bank: score / grade / причины
Bank -> BDB: SCORING → DECISION → правила → OFFER
note right of Bank: DECISION означает этап правил,\nне одобрение само по себе.
Bank -> Kafka: bank.events: публичный снимок с офертой
Kafka -> Client: Проекция
Client -> CDB: OFFER_AVAILABLE
UI -> Client: GET заявки (polling)
Client --> UI: Оферта и следующий шаг
User -> UI: Принять оферту
UI -> Client: POST /offer/accept
Client -> Kafka: client.events: OfferAccepted
Kafka -> Bank: Подтверждение действия
Bank -> BDB: OFFER_ACCEPTED
Bank -> Kafka: bank.events: FORMALIZING
Kafka -> Client: Обновление проекции
User -> UI: Демо-подпись
UI -> Client: POST /sign
Client -> Kafka: client.events: ContractSigned
Kafka -> Bank: Подтверждение подписи
Bank -> BDB: SIGNING → DISBURSED (worker)
Bank -> Kafka: bank.events: DISBURSED
Kafka -> Client: Обновление проекции
UI -> Client: GET заявки (polling)
Client --> UI: DISBURSED — симуляция
@enduml
